  <title>Preferred Tools for USB Characterization at HiTech</title>
  <body>
    <section outputclass="col-container-1">
      <div outputclass="col-1">
        <p>Preferred Tools for USB Characterization at <text>HiTech</text> </p>
      </div>
      <div outputclass="col-2">
        <p outputclass="desc_circle">A</p>
        <p outputclass="col-subtitle">HiTech typically utilizes Tektronix oscilloscopes for USB characterization</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Due to their high precision, reliable performance, and compatibility with USB compliance testing requirements.</li>
          <li>These oscilloscopes are well-suited for capturing and analyzing high-speed signals to ensure adherence to USB standards.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div outputclass="col-3">
