    <section outputclass="section2_text-image-wrapper">
      <div outputclass="section2_text-wrapper">
        <p outputclass="para-text">When opting for oscilloscopes from other manufacturers, it is essential to verify that they support the bandwidth, sampling rate, and protocol decoding capabilities required for accurate USB signal analysis.</p>
        <p outputclass="info"> Following USB-IF guidelines ensures effective USB characterization and device compliance with performance standards. </p>
